  id: Snow_Campfire_4
  headerName: The trees
  content: "\tNow I understand why the trees here barely reach knee height. It isn't
    that they're young. It's that they cannot grow. Their roots reach down, searching
    for minerals, and stop dead when they hit the frozen wall underground. A wall
    that never thaws."
